# Database migration working files.
#
# `npm run db:cutover` (and db:export / db:export:api) write a full dump of the
# application's production data here -- every row of every table. That must never be
# committed: it is the entire dataset, and a repository is not where it belongs.
# The export is still needed on disk until the new database has been observed, so it is
# ignored rather than deleted.
#
# Scoped to the export directory ONLY, not to *.jsonl: data/audit/ and data/metrics/ hold
# tracked .jsonl evidence artifacts that belong in the repository.
migration-export/
migration-export-*/
